      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar May-01-2012 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled this day for OSC hearing for Change of Name of a minor.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Donald Sullivan, Clerk: S. Vantree, CSR: Sonia Wong, #11288<br>Petitioners JILLIAN CHIN (mother) and VIRGIL CHIN (father) was present in pro per as Guardian ad Litem for the minor HAYDEN-AZURE-CHIN.<br>Petitioners were placed under oath and examined.<br><br>Proof of Publication is in the file.<br>No objections to the proposed change of names were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and sufficient, and that the petition should be granted.<br><br>The Court grants the petition for Change of Name of the Minor to BLUE HAYDEN- CHIN.<br>Decree Changing Name was submitted to and signed by the Court.<br>",
